<p>You unleash the glorious vision of the past when the continent was filled with death and plagues.</p><p>All foes in range <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> catch a dire plague for 5 turns, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">41, 55, 66, 75, 83</acronym> darkness damage each turn.</p><p>The Dire Plague is considered a disease but is not prevented by disease immunity.</p><p>Every turn there is a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2%, 3%, 4%, 6%, 7%</acronym> chance of a piece of the soul to be ripped away, increasing your souls by 1.</p><p></p>